WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.758
Andreina Aular's website was the first one I made,

2
00:00:02.758 --> 00:00:05.020
right after my first programming courses.

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.620
It was literally a WordPress site.

4
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.022
But I designed the whole thing myself in Figma,

5
00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:10.410
from scratch.

6
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.880
I published it and kept updating it.

7
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.552
Later it was rebuilt in WordPress and came out much

8
00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:21.000
better, but the skeleton was mine.

9
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.818
Back in 2020…
